#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD0004-A expect=noViolation domain=APDM
#note "Conformant case and the GROUNDING pin for the whole -A family: an AP dataset's DOMAIN really is the four-character dataset name. prefix('APDM',4)='APDM' == DOMAIN='APDM' -> silent."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset APDM
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN  type=Char
col APID    type=Char
col RSUBJID type=Char
col SREL    type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | APDM | AP-001 | 01-701-1015 | MOTHER, BIOLOGICAL
